Remove appstream dependency from adw-about-window.c for QNX.

appstream is not available on QNX. The only user is adw_about_window_new_from_appdata(),
which parses .appdata.xml files at runtime. This function is not used by gtk-llm-chat
or other QNX applications, so stub it out to return an empty AdwAboutWindow.

--- a/src/adw-about-window.c
+++ b/src/adw-about-window.c
